<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The ten battery chemistry terms prescribed by the draft labelling Implementing Act under Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, as listed in BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 39. Declared as individuals of the cross-sectoral class dpp:MaterialType of the CORE MAT module and reached through the inherited dpp:hasMaterialType. Replaces the free-text chemistry names of the battery-materials module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
