<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EU DPP Battery Chemistries Vocabulary"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "batchem" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries#" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-chemistries> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Developed against the CIRPASS-2 CORE ontology v2.0.5 (refresh of 25 August 2026; P_DPP v2.0.6 of 27 August 2026, MAT v1.0.2). To be revisited when MAT v2 lands (ontologies-core#24, #25) and when the labelling Implementing Act is adopted."@en .
